Zeta5.Axioms.chebyshev_theta_asymptotic : Tendsto (fun x => Chebyshev.theta x / x) atTop (𝓝 1)
def Chebyshev.theta : ℝ → ℝ :=
fun x => ∑ p ∈ Finset.Ioc 0 ⌊x⌋₊ with Nat.Prime p, Real.log ↑p
